  "body": "<!--\r\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\r\n-->\r\n\r\nMerging https://github.com/WICG/cross-origin-embedder-policy to the HTML spec.\r\n\r\n - HTML (this PR)\r\n   - Define \"embedder policy\", document's embedder policy,\r\n     WorkerGlobalScope's embedder policy, and environment settings\r\n     object's embedder policy.\r\n   - Specify how to parse a `cross-origin-embedder-policy` HTTP header.\r\n   - Specify how to set embedder policies for documents and workers (except\r\n      for service workers).\r\n - fetch: https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1030\r\n    - Define response URL serialization for reporting.\r\n    - Modify the cross-origin resource policy check.\r\n    - Run a cross-origin resource policy check for a response coming from\r\n       a service worker.\r\n - service worker: https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/pull/1516\r\n    - Define ServiceWorkerGlobalScope's embedder policy.\r\n    - Specify how to set embedder policy for service workers.\r\n    - Add a cross-origin resource policy check call in the Cache.matchAll\r\n       algorithm.\r\n - worklet: https://github.com/w3c/css-houdini-drafts/pull/992\r\n    - Define WorkletWorkerGlobalScope's embedder policy.\r\n \r\nThis fixes #5368, #5634, whatwg/fetch#985, and w3c/ServiceWorker#1490.\r\n\r\nThis doesn't fix the following issues:\r\n\r\n - cross-origin isolation related: \r\n   - #4175\r\n   - #4732\r\n   - #5122\r\n   - #5292\r\n   - #5435\r\n - #4916\r\n - #4919\r\n - #4930\r\n - #5223\r\n - #5391\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n   * Chrome\r\n   * Firefox\r\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n   * html/cross-origin-embedder-policy\r\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n   * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=887967\r\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1613061\r\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=210481\r\n\r\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n***\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/history.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/iana.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/iana.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/iana.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/offline.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/offline.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/offline.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/origin.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/references.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/window-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">/workers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5454/bb0bcac...ba656cf/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 11, 2020, 8:02 AM UTC (ba656cf)\">diff</a> )",
